    # JOAKIM "Which you can find through that door over there,"
    JOAKIM "Que se encuentra a través de esa puerta de allí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:125
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_4ed47257:

    # JOAKIM "...In there, you will find your set of scout gear, in your trunks."
    JOAKIM "...Allí, encontraréis vuestro equipo de explorador, en vuestros baúles."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:129
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_777a6773:

    # "I exhaled in relief."
    "Exhalé aliviado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:130
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_b9aa026b:

    # MC "(Fucking clown, what is his-)"
    MC "(Maldito payaso, ¿qué es-)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:129
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_b22da298:

    # JOAKIM "WHILE THERE, you will have another crucial objective to complete..."
    JOAKIM "MIENTRAS ESTÉIS ALLÍ, tendréis otro objetivo crucial que completar..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:130
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_36a034f7:

    # JOAKIM "Memorize where your fucking bunk is!"
    JOAKIM "¡Memorizad dónde está vuestra puta litera!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:134
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_59afb39a:

    # "The clutches of tension finally started to let go off the crowd as the realization of the nature of our {i}mission{/i} sunk in."
    "Las tensiones empezaron a ceder cuando la multitud se dio cuenta de la naturaleza de nuestra {i}misión{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:132
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_2601690c:

    # JOAKIM "After you greenhorns get your gear, you must swiftly execute a changing manoeuvre, then return here, to the yard."
    JOAKIM "Después de que los novatos os equipéis, debéis realizar rápidamente una maniobra de cambio y volver aquí, al patio."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:133
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_327382b8:

    # JOAKIM "Captain Duprey will then take over and... debrief you."
    JOAKIM "El Capitán Duprey se hará cargo y... os informará."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:134
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_707dbc6b:

    # JOAKIM "You've got but an hour to complete your mission."
    JOAKIM "Solo tenéis una hora para completar vuestra misión."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:138
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_ce970869:

    # "The quartermaster raised both his hands in the air for a moment of silence."
    "El intendente levantó ambas manos para guardar un momento de silencio."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:136
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_2c9a4efe:

    # JOAKIM "Make your Emperor proud now!"
    JOAKIM "¡Haced que vuestro emperador se sienta orgulloso!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:142
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_86334cba:

    # "A couple recruits moved to pose a question, but the quartermaster leapt off the wooden podium and walked swiftly towards the barracks without giving any of us another look."
    "Un par de reclutas se dispusieron a hacer una pregunta, pero el intendente saltó del podio de madera y se dirigió rápidamente hacia los barracones sin mirarnos a ninguno de nosotros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:142
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_e35d3e18:

    # MARKUS "So, [player_name!t], shall we discuss our mission strategy?"
    MARKUS "Entonces, [player_name!t], ¿discutimos nuestra estrategia de misión?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:147
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_f3485cca:

    # MARKUS "Or should we try and acquire that ass-et you've been evaluating?"
    MARKUS "¿O deberíamos intentar adquirir ese culo que has estado evaluando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:148
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_90451d66:

    # MC "*Sigh* Let's just get on with it."
    MC "*Suspiro* Pongámonos manos a la obra."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_2_ReturnHomeAndArriveToFort.rpy:150
translate es qst_Terminus_ArriveToFort_319da9b6:

    # MARKUS "It might be a mission-critical one!"
    MARKUS "¡Podría ser una misión crítica!"


